{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "Intro", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/46cd7503eb80378fd909e05034f1f3a8614a2cedaac80072fd3badc6f1387963.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46]]}, {"text": "Today I was handed an interesting project around improve the SEO surface area of an AngularJS SPA for a client.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/56fe1004216ed7c9620659286e0be377f3db39decdabc6e9629ec93b9a826c4a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.2], [11, 3.2, 3.6], [12, 3.6, 4.0], [13, 4.0, 4.26], [14, 4.26, 4.42], [17, 5.64, 5.86], [18, 5.86, 5.96], [19, 5.96, 6.22]]}, {"text": "After a bit of research on how to handle this, I decided that I should roll my own tool to solve this problem as it will give me greater flexibility later as opposed to going with a SaaS app like Prerender.io.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b1f5fe688a202105018c393ce53599a2d8bb7b2a570fa8c8b8ab591248ef0c1c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.58], [7, 1.58, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.36], [10, 2.76, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.28], [12, 3.28, 3.5], [13, 3.5, 3.6], [14, 3.6, 3.78], [15, 3.78, 3.98], [16, 3.98, 4.16], [17, 4.16, 4.36], [18, 4.36, 4.64], [19, 4.64, 4.86], [20, 4.86, 5.1], [21, 5.1, 5.32], [22, 5.32, 5.76], [23, 5.76, 6.24], [24, 6.24, 6.36], [25, 6.36, 6.46], [26, 6.46, 6.62], [28, 6.76, 7.06], [29, 7.06, 7.48], [30, 7.48, 8.16], [31, 8.16, 8.76], [32, 8.76, 9.0], [33, 9.0, 9.24], [34, 9.24, 9.46], [35, 9.46, 9.72], [36, 9.72, 9.84], [38, 10.08, 10.5], [39, 10.5, 10.7]]}, {"text": "Basic Concept", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fbefdbf955a6232c16b1c62ea8e6d26831d01f46151356d266a2e31d29de3038.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.72]]}, {"text": "Google says they are doing a much better job rendering Javascript on websites.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/da57e480e32046b9b5aca6ed170ca42e2c26e49ed90cc6b0fdc163b3a6391adf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.48], [7, 1.48, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.4], [11, 3.12, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.66]]}, {"text": "Awesome!", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8799702bf5f3205cf76bc71d2702c05aef12b77e9590e264648d567925dc369c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5]]}, {"text": "But what about the other guys?", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c6913e1305e164889925870300177ac5df200a78674e8351d6728de6282de2d9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.8], [5, 0.8, 1.08]]}, {"text": "What we are going to do is leverage PhantomJS to render the angularjs code on the fly as the server requests the dynamic pages.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/beae5b98460c763e2e54087f02288c34e27678fb498a3c99cfaf236a03f2fc5f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.86], [5, 0.86, 1.06], [6, 1.06, 1.36], [7, 1.36, 1.68], [9, 2.4, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.22], [13, 3.82, 4.2], [14, 4.2, 4.48], [15, 4.48, 4.58], [16, 4.58, 4.92], [17, 4.92, 5.54], [18, 5.54, 5.68], [19, 5.68, 5.98], [20, 5.98, 6.36], [21, 6.36, 6.78], [22, 6.78, 7.12], [23, 7.12, 7.58]]}, {"text": "This way we don’t have to deal with maintain a bunch of ERB files or pre-rendering static pages on our server.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f4931553f3fee067e6fcb4a77b5ec86b96bf28b4323003311aea1414a48a650d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.4], [8, 1.4, 1.76], [9, 1.76, 1.94], [10, 1.94, 2.1], [11, 2.1, 2.34], [12, 2.34, 2.68], [13, 2.68, 3.14], [14, 3.14, 3.6], [16, 4.18, 4.56], [17, 4.56, 4.94], [18, 4.94, 5.12], [19, 5.12, 5.26], [20, 5.26, 5.56]]}, {"text": "The cost will be that the page load time will be a bit slower unfortunately and these requests will be expensive on memory, but we just want the fast (dev time-wise) solution to hit the ground.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/46b1c5893d2fa8aedf2ce6f3752c7b08cd009c2edab909747bb1eae34444848a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.12], [6, 1.12, 1.32], [7, 1.32, 1.54], [8, 1.54, 1.8], [9, 1.8, 2.0], [10, 2.0, 2.12], [11, 2.12, 2.22], [12, 2.22, 2.38], [13, 2.38, 2.8], [14, 2.9, 3.48], [15, 4.08, 4.18], [16, 4.18, 4.36], [17, 4.36, 4.64], [18, 4.64, 4.88], [19, 4.88, 5.02], [20, 5.02, 5.46], [21, 5.46, 5.64], [22, 5.64, 5.94], [23, 6.4, 6.58], [24, 6.58, 6.7], [25, 6.7, 6.84], [26, 6.84, 7.02], [27, 7.02, 7.18], [28, 7.18, 7.64], [29, 7.9, 8.02], [31, 8.58, 9.08], [32, 9.08, 9.34], [33, 9.34, 9.46], [34, 9.46, 9.6], [35, 9.6, 9.84]]}, {"text": "PhantomJS client", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/61ad71c83dca43c4e6852c457129e540d15450751e839d64d20ae00b72cb2a33.mp3"}, {"text": "First you need to install PhantomJS.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/03f58ce58eb41fde72f74b21bacf4a6a216388c101cafd4f91c8a814625706f2.mp3"}, {"text": "If you are using Heroku to host your application, you will need to configure Heroku to run phantomjs with this build back.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bf3326b10d4d3dd40a662fe8b8184f60d52cb1b2e5703d4c4564f6334179b65c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.46], [9, 2.94, 3.0], [10, 3.0, 3.08], [11, 3.08, 3.22], [12, 3.22, 3.38], [13, 3.38, 3.8], [14, 3.8, 4.34], [15, 4.34, 4.58], [16, 4.58, 4.72], [18, 5.44, 5.76], [19, 5.76, 5.98], [21, 6.2, 6.44]]}, {"text": "Unfortunately there isn’t a great way to detect when the page is finished loading.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/633f83bbac0654ffd971797337e78d86dc94c08494e1470bb499cd3665de87f3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.64], [1, 0.88, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.32], [4, 1.32, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.44], [9, 2.44, 2.56], [10, 2.56, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 2.98], [12, 2.98, 3.22], [13, 3.22, 3.54]]}, {"text": "My trick to solve this problem is for all of the controllers to set a status flag on the body tag noting they are finished running.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/23f49ec059b2e22ace9412dea08fcd24fcab6afa7df00062a1a03bb6fad30ec8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.52], [6, 1.52, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.16], [9, 2.16, 2.3], [10, 2.3, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.1], [13, 3.1, 3.26], [14, 3.26, 3.38], [15, 3.38, 3.68], [16, 3.68, 4.0], [17, 4.0, 4.28], [18, 4.28, 4.4], [19, 4.4, 4.62], [20, 4.62, 4.96], [21, 5.14, 5.38], [22, 5.38, 5.66], [23, 5.66, 5.76], [24, 5.76, 6.14], [25, 6.14, 6.56]]}, {"text": "Now all of my controllers look like this:", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/49a3e517d0bbb5ba8af564b6559794a17a8ce96c0b21a8abc030065e325ca803.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.12]]}, {"text": "```coffeescript app/assets/javascripts/app/controllers/index.js.coffee app.controller ‘IndexCtrl’, ($scope, $rootScope) -> … $rootScope.status = ‘ready’;", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8da3bf76566b8ed251956bc0a068e78dd1408801074637930f56874885185cff.mp3"}, {"text": "So now I can watch the data-status to see when angular has finished running.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f26355ee21f641d3b02259e490fb3b340a924c7f0d480988461daae9dc28d8f2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.06], [7, 1.6, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.2], [10, 2.2, 2.52], [11, 2.52, 2.8], [12, 2.8, 3.14], [13, 3.14, 3.42]]}, {"text": "Now lets create a angularjs-to-static.js.coffee file.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bb03bc1fba67aace19664bad8246fb38d90ae884374b73de30aabbb53857be99.mp3"}, {"text": "This will take in a URL and spit out the html for the page using PhantomJS.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/33aab965eb8a3aaef72aa65f350eee910d6ee33e1d5607f1e098c0977ad46792.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.48], [5, 0.68, 1.06], [6, 1.06, 1.44], [7, 1.44, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 1.92], [10, 1.92, 2.32], [11, 2.32, 2.62], [12, 2.62, 2.72], [13, 2.72, 2.96], [14, 2.96, 3.26]]}, {"text": "```coffeescript lib/phantomjs/angularjs_to_static.js.coffee #", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4e554a67eede38e9f8a32f3c8583da35f3c4a05b6d9eab212c393cd480323831.mp3"}, {"text": "angularjs_to_static.js.coffee", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7c814108fd542cbad391a51447332ebb341aa8646e04e9b94f51289a768dd8cd.mp3"}, {"text": "#", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/40ac0c7cefa2d99025ab528ac9a9e297378e9623a55cedbba05517a4d1f5d50a.mp3"}, {"text": "This script takes a URL as argument.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4b94e5b2aeb38f35f926f64dce802432764518f73ee860a44f3021ef69be347f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.36]]}, {"text": "(In that order!)", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/727b827a4f6fe9d7b7662705c4ed3d31e1a044087560396bf4edfe0a73985203.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.62, 0.76], [2, 0.76, 1.0]]}, {"text": "The script then runs the Javascript on this page and waits until Ember has finished loading.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/96313468ba06d38d5f33e6f091687ac05ab513d7e7390df9718eb6aa8a4a46eb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.58], [9, 2.88, 2.98], [10, 2.98, 3.16], [11, 3.16, 3.54], [12, 3.54, 3.8], [13, 3.8, 3.96], [14, 3.96, 4.24], [15, 4.24, 4.56]]}, {"text": "It then renders the resulting static HTML page to the console.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/81dc00adae3deae6b0a799aea214026488636536a2b3c7e3a598a93a6732f240.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.82], [7, 2.3, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.0], [10, 3.0, 3.34]]}, {"text": "#", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/40ac0c7cefa2d99025ab528ac9a9e297378e9623a55cedbba05517a4d1f5d50a.mp3"}, {"text": "Keep track of whether the page has already been exported.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/102d43c210b71da4ef6e41fdff7f01c371d41efa31ed6558a69b45112b191770.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.42]]}, {"text": "The ‘setTimeout’ mess might cause it to be exported multiple times.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6ab7c6556960edc29b61e4b432fff1497c50e6b10db63190c34f75e0558bed70.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [3, 0.84, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.22], [9, 2.22, 2.54], [10, 2.54, 3.0]]}, {"text": "exportPageContents = -> unless pageHasBeenExported pageHasBeenExported = true console.log page.content console.log “Finished.”", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fb4527de551311e95b6ca31102c12b8dd11639142777e05703cec0fd1aa9085d.mp3"}, {"text": "unless silence phantom.exit() return", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eca3c2849c70a60c40b3376a08aee5ca843e2ea15e8cd5c984173cdda654a2bf.mp3"}, {"text": "#wait until angularjs says its ready waitForStatus = (page, callback) -> expiration = (new Date()).getTime() + 10000", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7e44d17e97717c03a2efd82bbc5ce8888dc13eed95c332865189eaf0e143ca28.mp3"}, {"text": "# try and fetch the desired element from the page result = page.evaluate(-> document.body ) system.stderr.writeLine result", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7f156101e38a60c1d42384a967ce612dee21927f03f6053dd766c737025e7577.mp3"}, {"text": "# if desired element found then call callback after 50ms if result system.stderr.writeLine “- trigger found” unless silence window.setTimeout (-> callback() return ), 50 return", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/23e96df1447f50cb4f3bd42af2baad4a0f992282ebedfcbef6d7b726ec7b7e0e.mp3"}, {"text": "# determine whether timeout is triggered finish = (new Date()).getTime() if finish > expiration system.stderr.writeLine “- timed out” unless silence callback() return", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bc7a2f07588ac8a1178b36818c1cbc452c55a6154e471c511eb2a8763e1ef287.mp3"}, {"text": "# haven’t timed out, haven’t found object, so poll in another 100ms window.setTimeout (-> waitForStatus page, waitForStatus return ), 100 return", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/dbed082508e54533219cb18af3dd4077acf4e92677c5a86dde4c91aca2310224.mp3"}, {"text": "fs = require(“fs”) system = require(“system”) page = require(“webpage”).create() pageHasBeenExported = false script = undefined url = undefined silence = undefined script = system.args[0]", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/91d9b0d2c1b3da723c8436173fbf07e7520c81725174f3b4294bfbfa7f97ca04.mp3"}, {"text": "if system.args.length < 2 or system.args.length > 3", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cade9c037f5b58a8b207e133dc13d892d35ae4ebdbdebb722564f2a6c3b57c4b.mp3"}, {"text": "# Output usage info and exit.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d5b3475d368365559202a640c089e75c34f411f5ce6dd227749ccf2e03fa854d.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.0, 0.5], [3, 0.84, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.58], [5, 1.58, 1.88]]}, {"text": "console.log “Usage: “ + script + “ URL [silence]” console.log “ URL: address to open and run” console.log “ silence: enter ‘silence’ (without quotes) to only output the page content and suppress info messages” phantom.exit 1 else url = system.args[1] silence = (system.args[2] is “silence”) console.log “Will render “ + url + “.”", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/55b9705689b20faa8db5964a102e6b5cb79718f6f49c2ba32e3e220981b867fe.mp3"}, {"text": "unless silence page.open url, (status) -> unless status is “success” console.log “Unable to load URL!”", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/954b405515d65a47238836efdf6e2d1cfcba0bcb00dc501d38adc14425ddfb5a.mp3"}, {"text": "unless silence phantom.exit() else", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b0cc5976541d954d9a73ff2b1e4d6c634206024ee1b13d7a53b23bc28d54f96e.mp3"}, {"text": "Side note", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0c84fc95cf6bf3c349074ca5a6d709f39f76b97c828acfd702b7cadac8aa5b13.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.6]]}, {"text": "Much of this script was borrowed from Ember.js, Google Ajax crawling and Rails, but I didn’t like he was detecting with angularjs was finished.", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/184863eefed5306898a4afbba3e27adb425d045d0c8e3664a7588c35ca13cf09.mp3"}, {"text": "He was waiting for the page to finish its server requests, added some padding time and then finished.", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9cfd257c0912ab9f4439837ecf9387bc6a3008735cf4f00e69d9c0434d312f5c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 0.86], [5, 0.86, 1.08], [6, 1.08, 1.34], [7, 1.34, 1.6], [8, 1.6, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 2.12], [10, 2.12, 2.68], [11, 3.16, 3.36], [12, 3.36, 3.62], [13, 3.62, 3.88], [14, 3.88, 4.26], [15, 4.48, 4.54], [16, 4.54, 4.66], [17, 4.66, 5.18]]}, {"text": "Waiting for the flag to be set is a better technique, because I know angular has finished.", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0daed88cfdeb0eff6138a054cebad4fb0ad79128c28aab3b1eeaa18105e4ec1c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 1.76], [9, 1.76, 1.96], [10, 1.96, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.18], [13, 3.18, 3.34], [14, 3.34, 3.76], [15, 3.76, 4.02], [16, 4.02, 4.36]]}, {"text": "Essentially this script takes in a URL, loads the page, and then waits for the flag to be set.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/37fd3d68fe7b4ae0f07832518cad891aa1ecdadbb6e9032c1a0427a5409e0f7a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66], [2, 0.94, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.58], [4, 1.58, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 2.28], [7, 2.7, 2.86], [8, 2.86, 3.02], [9, 3.02, 3.44], [10, 3.62, 3.82], [11, 3.82, 3.94], [12, 3.94, 4.16], [13, 4.16, 4.4], [14, 4.4, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 4.76], [16, 4.76, 5.0], [17, 5.0, 5.12], [18, 5.12, 5.34]]}, {"text": "If the flag takes longer than 30s to be set, it bails and just renders what it has.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/75593e7bc2e28bb00922f69c0750084cfe37f6a5a4c7e93e1f481cd77272f6af.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.24], [10, 2.58, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 3.02], [12, 3.02, 3.3], [13, 3.3, 3.44], [14, 3.44, 3.88], [15, 3.88, 4.04], [16, 4.04, 4.18], [17, 4.18, 4.46]]}, {"text": "If you are on Heroku, you may need to shorten this flag to 15s, because Heroku has a request timeout of 30s.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8ceeb125b077617ccd66ac6c6f1dfe20cc66cbe1c295c691366901ecb49b1c32.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 1.04], [5, 1.46, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.84], [8, 1.84, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.48], [11, 2.48, 2.68], [12, 2.68, 2.88], [13, 2.88, 3.66], [14, 3.66, 4.12], [15, 4.12, 4.6], [16, 4.6, 4.76], [17, 4.76, 4.88], [18, 4.88, 5.16], [20, 5.66, 5.86], [21, 5.86, 6.38]]}, {"text": "Part 2", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0d3a0c8ff1c827a896e9afcccb8e5a08c049c1bfe13bedb877255a44681da748.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.58]]}]}